# No AI Slop (JasonOS writing)

When drafting or editing any prose Jason will send or publish — emails, cover letters, Post Machine LinkedIn/blog drafts, outreach messages, Tell Claude drafts, resume wording — follow the **no-ai-slop** skill.

- Skill path: [`.cursor/skills/no-ai-slop/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/no-ai-slop/SKILL.md) (from https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop)
- Runtime prompts already inject shared rules via [`jasonos/lib/ai/no-ai-slop.ts`](jasonos/lib/ai/no-ai-slop.ts) into Jason identity / Post Machine / resume generators.

Preserve Jason's blunt operator voice. Cut binary contrasts, faux-insight setups, throat-clearing, importance puffery, banned buzzwords, dramatic mic-drop endings, and em-dash crutches. Prefer concrete facts and active voice. Never invent sources or stats.
